            "offsetBasis": "nfc-ws-collapse/1"
          }
        },
        {
          "ref": "loc-wl-483",
          "selectorKind": "TEXT_QUOTE",
          "quote": "At the conclusion of the inspection on October 14, 2025, our investigator provided you with a Form FDA 483, Inspectional Observations (FDA 483). We acknowledge receipt of your response dated October 29, 2025.",
