        {
          "ref": "loc-wl-drugclaim",
          "selectorKind": "TEXT_QUOTE",
          "quote": "“ImuTek Colostrum-5 Capsules and Powder. . . . has been shown to kill bacteria and viral invaders. It can also help correct bowel dysfunction by stimulating tissue repair.”",
